{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-2","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与平方与整数","englishTitle":"If two numbers by multiplying one another make a square number, they are similar plane numbers.","book":9,"number":2,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.2","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.2/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":2,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-2@raw-81558de8946179ea","contentId":"euclid-9-2","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"81558de8946179eae013234e1b47c2a36801b630d8d8f9facc97ad494a02543f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-2.statement","euclid-9-2.construction.1","euclid-9-2.construction.2","euclid-9-2.proof.1","euclid-9-2.proof.2","euclid-9-2.proof.3","euclid-9-2.proof.4","euclid-9-2.conclusion","euclid-9-2.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-2.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-2","revisionId":"euclid-9-2@raw-81558de8946179ea","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"898af5303be67787a7b175daf72fbd090d99f3c26964138dbe00b7effe292bb2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two numbers by multiplying one another make a square number, they are similar plane numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个数字通过相互乘法 得出平方数,它们就是相似平面数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-2.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-2","revisionId":"euclid-9-2@raw-81558de8946179ea","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6856f9ea631d65cf90a13bd440168d45617daf006d30acd5616977f2f1538dea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be two numbers, and let A by multiplying B make the square number C; I say that A, B are similar plane numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B成为两个数字,让A乘以B,使平方数,C成为相似平面数,B是相似平面数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-2.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-2","revisionId":"euclid-9-2@raw-81558de8946179ea","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c71b685e0a6fe6381b8e663bb65cb70bc9de75aa1c71e1cd5e2f2e0458762217","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let A by multiplying itself make D; therefore D is square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A乘以D,D乘以平方数"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-2.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-2","revisionId":"euclid-9-2@raw-81558de8946179ea","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"03a5a6ab4d224032257bde2f5ad1eb7479c55a349e4e555c61a61d0c508404e7","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since A by multiplying itself has made D, and by multiplying B has made C, therefore, as A is to B, so is D to C. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,A乘以本身就已经达到D,B乘以B,C,A比B等于D比C；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 C 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-2.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-2","revisionId":"euclid-9-2@raw-81558de8946179ea","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84f510b903049ba8d48929e84fbacadfa5a14f3d77688234ad72323354b698df","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since D is square, and C is so also, therefore D, C are similar plane numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D是平方数,C也是,D,C是相似平面数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-2.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-2","revisionId":"euclid-9-2@raw-81558de8946179ea","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2bc42a15b15ace4ceeac8b8d001ad60cb2805fd6507b13f36e77df5bcbdc1660","citations":["euclid-8-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore one mean proportional number falls between D, C. [[VIII. 18](/principles/euclid-8-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,一个比例中项个数字在D,C之间。 [[VIII. 18](/principles/euclid-8-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-2.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-2","revisionId":"euclid-9-2@raw-81558de8946179ea","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0a31e7ee9ce32367f4cc8a56940ed4b52fa4443b743ff9a76ce5eb6614c074f6","citations":["euclid-8-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as D is to C, so is A to B; therefore one mean proportional number falls between A, B also. [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D比C等于A比B,因此,比例中项的人数也下降了A,B；D 与 C 之比等于 A 与 B 之比。 [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-2.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-2","revisionId":"euclid-9-2@raw-81558de8946179ea","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c93e2fb05205beff3ab4b179538d6473890093901ce206ef46392770b8211ae","citations":["euclid-8-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if one mean proportional number fall between two numbers, they are similar plane numbers; [[VIII. 20](/principles/euclid-8-20)] therefore A, B are similar plane numbers. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果一个比例中项个数字在两个数字之间下降,它们就为相似平面数个;因此,A,B是相似平面数个。 [[VIII. 20](/principles/euclid-8-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-2.source","contentId":"euclid-9-2","revisionId":"euclid-9-2@raw-81558de8946179ea","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a4a8187cc5f6c3949ed453623e94ab7a392ee5f510a0ecbf87db8b18c68f7b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.2/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.2\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-2:euclid-7-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-2.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"VII. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-2:euclid-8-18:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-2.proof.3","euclid-9-2.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-18","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:gr